  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1297B"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is55">
        <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e98">Caput 55</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_1@2-4">Omnes sitientes, venite.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is55-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is55-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e113">Quia vas fictum contra Ecclesiam dixerat conterendum, et omnem linguam armatam contra scientiam Dei superandam, provocat credentes ad fluvium Dei, qui repletus est aquis.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e116">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e118" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_1@15-15">Comedite.</quote>
            Audiendo, loquendo, legendo, meditando, operando, corde retinendo. Divina siquidem Scriptura, et potus est, aperta: et cibus, occulta. Ipsa etiam et aqua est et panis qui de coelo descendit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e125">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_2@1-3">Quare appenditis argentum.</quote>
            Pensatis sacra eloquia, sed non refectionem. Qui solam speciem litterae custoditis, de spirituali intelligentia pinguedinem <pb ed="#P" n="1297C"/> internae refectionis amittitis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e136">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e138">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e140">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_4@1-2">Ecce testem.</quote>
            Provocavit Judaeos ad credendum, sed quia sciebat illis non credentibus gentiles esse credituros, dicit se filium misisse qui praecepta ipsius populis nuntiaret.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e147">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e149">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_5@16-18">Dominum Deum tuum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is55-Rd1e156"><name xml:id="gom-is55-Nd1e157" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e160">Quando Pater dicitur, Pater Christi secundum divinitatem dicitur Pater gloriae: secundum humanitatem, Pater Domini nostri Jesu Christi.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e167">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_6@1-2">Quaerite Dominum.</quote>
            Haec pertinent ad Judaeos vel ad gentes specialiter, et ad unumquemque generaliter. Propheta ad Judaeos: <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e174" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_6@1-2">Quaerite Dominum,</quote> quasi diceret: Gentes suscipiunt misericordias David, et vos dedignamini, sed agite poenitentiam, et convertimini dum tempus habetis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e178">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1297D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e182" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_6@8-9">Dum prope.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is55-Rd1e185"><name xml:id="gom-is55-Nd1e186" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e189">Ne vestris vitiis recedat, qui appropinquat appropinquantibus sibi, et filio revertenti laetus occurrit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e193">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e195">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e197">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e199" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_8@1-2">Non enim.</quote>
            Ne putetis difficile esse quod spondeo: considerate quod inter mea et vestra consilia multa sit differentia: et quanta naturae, tanta voluntatis diversitas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e204">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e206">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e208">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e210" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_10@1-2">Et quomodo.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is55-Rd1e213"><name xml:id="gom-is55-Nd1e214" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e217">Alia similitudine ostendit quia multus est ad ignoscendum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e220">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e222" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_10@29-30">Panem comedenti.</quote>
            Unde Salomon: <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e225">Mitte panem tuum super aquas, quia in multitudine dierum invenies eum,</quote> hoc est, panem doctrinae tuae et gratiam spiritualem cunctis infunde, quia in novissimo praemia recipies
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e229">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e231">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e233">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1298A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_11@10-11">Non revertetur.</quote>
            Sed postquam meam impleverit voluntatem in terris, redibit et sedebit a dextris meis, secundum illud, <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e240" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc20_42@12-15">Sede a dextris meis,</quote> etc.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e247">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_12@9-9">Montes,</quote>
            scilicet animae sanctorum quae pro varietate virtutum montes appellantur et colles.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is55-Dd1e256">
          <head xml:id="gom-is55-Hd1e258">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e260">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e262" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_13@1-2">Pro saliuncula.</quote>
            Saliuncula, aculeis et punctionibus plena. Abies, alta, procera, fabricandis domibus apta, pice fecunda.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is55-d1e266">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is55-Qd1e268" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is55_13@10-12">Et erit Dominus.</quote>
            Alii. Et erit Dominus in nomen et in signum sempiternum quod non deficiet.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
